      "id": "claim_90cf68f0b223468a93200c6d8739274b",
      "statement": "Audit responses are the only signed responses: GET /v1/audit/head, /v1/audit/log, /v1/audit/checkpoints, /v1/audit/verify, and /v1/agents/{fp}/audit go through _send_signed, which adds X-HAAP-Directory-Signature (base64 Ed25519 over the canonical JSON of the exact response body, produced by AuditService.sign_body) and X-HAAP-Directory-Fingerprint; search, profile, register, and health responses are unsigned.",
