      "id": "claim_5e041c8e97714aef87b780db1629dd45",
      "statement": "GET /health is unversioned, unauthenticated, and unthrottled and returns service.health: {status, version, protocol_version, agents (store.count_live after lazy prune), suspended, pending_verifications, chain_seq (L5 audit head), uptime_s, directory_fingerprint, api: {completion_route: /v1/register/complete}} — no sensitive data, and the api.completion_route field machine-states which register-completion alias is canonical.",
