      "id": "claim_b66ac49231bf4cbd9453035b7fe2fdc5",
      "statement": "GET /metrics renders plain Prometheus-style text (Content-Type text/plain; version=0.0.4) from telemetry.render_metrics with the metric names haapd_agents_listed, haapd_agents_suspended, haapd_agents_total, haapd_audit_seq, haapd_ops_total, haapd_uptime_seconds, and haapd_rejections_total{code=...} (one line per observed rejection code); rejection codes appear automatically because the counters are bumped while error envelopes are serialized.",
