    {
      "id": "claim_fafb2b2aeb1b4557b2507f2452d82d2c",
      "statement": "Register and completion statuses differ by route version: POST /v1/register returns 202 while legacy POST /register returns 200 with the challenge shape the unmodified client reads; /v1/register/complete returns 201 while legacy /register/complete and the tolerated alias /v1/register/challenge return 200. The register-completion and heartbeat handlers are not IP-rate-limited (completion requires a previously issued challenge).",
