    {
      "id": "claim_9713128abc6149eb916a307f7129a651",
      "statement": "The heartbeat handler dispatches by route version and body: a signed body (signature plus timestamp present) or a /v1/heartbeat path forces the signed heartbeat_v1 validation, while an unsigned {fingerprint} body is accepted on either /heartbeat or /v1/heartbeat via heartbeat_legacy and answers 200 {status: ok} or 404 UNKNOWN_OR_EXPIRED (which never confirms fingerprint existence).",
